  "details": "Add the option to set an emoji as an addition to the status message.\nThe emoji is displayed on top of the status icon (blue, green, orange, red) in the social menu.\nThis can be set accessed in a similar way as emojis are now. Through a quick menu without having to go into the social menu.\nThe available emojis should of course be activity related.\nThe advantages of this system are that you can quickly set the status in VR without having to type and they are quicker to read because other don't have to view the profile to see the status.\nExamples:\nUsing film emoji show that you are watching a movie.\nUsing the camera emoji to show that you are streaming.\nUsing the dance emoji to show that you are well dancing.\nUsing the Zzz emoji to show that you are tired or sleeping.",
